cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "fair-data-learning"
abstract: >-
  Learning repository demonstrating FAIR semantic data infrastructure, data
  science, and MLOps using materials science data from the Materials Project.
  Includes a reproducible DVC pipeline (band-gap prediction), MLflow experiment
  tracking, RDF knowledge graph with SPARQL queries, and RO-Crate metadata.
authors:
